  "body": "? Brand-new home with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n? Approx. 258sqm of living on a 503sqm (approx.) freehold section\r\n? 6 generous bedrooms, 3 stylish bathrooms, 2 separate living areas and double internal-access garage\r\n? Flexible two-bedroom granny potential with its own living area and bathroom\r\n? Backing onto a peaceful native reserve with a tranquil green outlook\r\n? Designer kitchen with stone island, walk-in pantry and quality appliances\r\n? Spacious kwila deck with seamless indoor-outdoor living\r\n? Central air conditioning, sound system, intercom and excellent storage throughout\r\n\r\nPositioned in the sought-after Millwater community, this beautifully designed home backs onto a peaceful native reserve, offering generous living spaces, modern comfort and the flexibility to suit growing or multi-generational families. With approximately 258sqm of thoughtfully planned living, it delivers the perfect balance of style, practicality and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features an excellent two-bedroom granny potential, complete with a separate living area and bathroom. Whether accommodating extended family, welcoming guests or creating a private space for teenagers, this versatile layout easily adapts to your family's changing needs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home. The contemporary kitchen is equipped with quality appliances, a generous stone island and a walk-in pantry, while a second lounge provides additional space for relaxing, entertaining or family time.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors open onto a spacious kwila deck and landscaped garden, creating seamless indoor-outdoor flow. Backing directly onto the native reserve, the outdoor area enjoys a peaceful green outlook, making it an inviting space for entertaining, family gatherings or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nThe master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while three additional bedrooms are serviced by a stylish family bathroom with a bathtub. A dedicated study nook adds extra functionality for working from home or study.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include central air conditioning, built-in sound system, intercom, under-stair storage and a double internal-access garage with a convenient laundry area.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to quality schools, parks, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, motorway access and Orewa Beach, this exceptional home offers flexible family living in one of Millwater's most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
